tion 5.6)\n- exp-017: LLaMA×CoNLL (Table 3)\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nWrite a detailed review covering:\n\n1. **Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n2. **Strengths** (focus on methodology and experimental design)\n3. **Weaknesses** (focus on methodology and experimental design)\n4. **Questions for authors**\n5. **Minor issues**\n6. **Overall assessment** (1-2 sentences)\n7. **Scores**: Overall (1-6), Confidence (1-5)\n\nBe thorough, critical, and fair. Evaluate:\n- Is the experimental methodology sound?\n- Are the comparisons fair and comprehensive?\n- Are the statistical analyses adequate?\n- Is the evaluation protocol well-designed?\n- Are the conclusions supported by the evidence?\n- Are there methodological gaps or flaws?\n- Is the best-of-N selection protocol fair to instance-level signals?\n\nRemember: this is evaluated against top ML venue standards (~25% acceptance rate).","uuid":"5ad1d242-1681-4efc-b2a5-dd90fbe8d6c8","session_id":"a188aefa-23b6-4688-b448-164a4ee4e586"}
