{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V2Usy9mcg5ifwKu8aNDSYZ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp008_re_n16（准备中）\\\\n- exp_002_merge_conll2003（准备中）\\\\n- exp_007_ner_llama（准备中）\\\\n- exp001_seed456（准备中）\\\\n- exp001_seed123（准备中）\\\\n- exp_001_n16_seed456_full（准备中）\\\\n- exp_001_n16_seed123_full（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_017_llama_conll_n16_s456** (success): LLaMA CoNLL N=16 seed=456: structural>surface ranking preserved across seeds, complementing Qwen SciERC 3-seed protocol\\\\n- **exp_017_llama_conll_n16** (success): —\\\\n- **exp_017_llama_conll_n16_s123** (success): LLaMA CoNLL N=16 seed=123: structural>surface ranking preserved across seeds, complementing Qwen SciERC 3-seed protocol\\\\n  [exp_017_llama_conll_n16_s123_5signal_report](autodl-5090:/root/autodl-tmp/struct_self_consist_ie/output/exp_017_llama_conll_n16_s123/all_signals_report.json)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 36 / 负向 17 / 失败 1 / 共 56\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- ft_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pilot_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008_re_n16_full: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1038, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LJ37fBMNoZL1Xtr8mQcjgu","session_id":"a188aefa-23b6-4688-b448-164a4ee4e586","uuid":"b5bbfe9a-7462-40a2-be2d-22da8d978e22","timestamp":"2026-05-14T21:31:24.597Z"}
