n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 WNUT-17 benchmark，聚焦 SciERC + CoNLL 双数据集；取消 LLaMA WNUT-17 fine-tuning\\\\n  rationale: exp_003_wnut17_v2_infer FAIL：54% F1=0（即使 downsample empty 到 25%），SJ full\\\\n    rho=0.062 (p=0.106 不显著)，logprob full rho=-0.411（异常负相关）。模型在社交媒体 NER 上严重不足，structural\\\\n    consistency 信号在此基础上无意义。继续投入（调 T/调 prompt/训 LLaMA WNUT-17）的期望收益低于成本。SciERC + CoNLL（科学+新闻，两个域）已构成充分的\\\\n    cross-dataset 证据。DDL 还 11 天，资源应集中在已有正面信号的实验线。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_wnut17_v2_infer\\\\n    role: WNUT-17 推理\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: 54% F1=0, SJ rho=0.062 (p=0.106), logprob rho=-0.411'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D040\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 3-seed NER 协议完成：seed42 ρ=0.428, seed123 ρ=0.424, seed456 ρ=0.384; cross-seed\\\\n    一致性确认\\\\n  rationale: exp_001_seed456_v2_ner 结果：SJ full rho=0.384, structural_beats_surface=true\\\\n    (+0.160)。三个 seed 一致显示 structural > surface，但 seed456 略低于 seed42/123（0.384 vs 0.428/0.424,\\\\n    Δ≈0.04）。greedy_f1=0.664, oracle=0.811, 12.3% F1=0——均在正常范围。verdict=MARGINAL 但 structural_beats_surface=true\\\\n    是核心 claim 的直接支持。3-seed 均值 ρ≈0.412，SD≈0.025，robustness 充分。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed456_v2_ner\\\\n    role: 3-seed 第三个\\\\n    result: 'MARGINAL: SJ rho=0.384, structural>surface +0.160'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: seed42\\\\n    result: SJ rho=0.428\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed123_v2\\\\n    role: seed123\\\\n    result: SJ rho=0.424\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D045\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: WNUT-17 放弃深入：54% F1=0 + SJ rho 不显著，报告为 Claim 3 支撑证据；取消 LLaMA WNUT-17\\\\n  rationale: exp_003_wnut17_v2_infer 结果：greedy_f1=0.525, 54% F1=0, SJ full rho=0.062\\\\n    (p=0.106 不显著), logprob full rho=-0.411（异常负相关）。即使 downsample 到 25% empty，模型在社交媒体\\\\n    NER 上能力不足，structural consistency 信号无意义。与 RE 的 44% F1=0 相同模式——超出模型能力边界时所有信号失效。决策：(1)\\\\n    WNUT-17 不再追加投入（不调 T/prompt）；(2) 取消已授权的 LLaMA WNUT-17 fine-tuning；(3) 论文中报告为 Claim\\\\n    3（task-complexity boundary）的跨数据集支撑——当模型 F1=0 比例超过 50% 时信号退化，与 RE 发现一致。论文 cross-dataset\\\\n    证据用 SciERC + CoNLL-2003 两个正面数据集。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_wnut17_v2_infer\\\\n    role: WNUT-17 inference\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: 54% F1=0, SJ full rho=0.062 (not significant), logprob rho=-0.411'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_wnut17_v2\\\\n    role: WNUT-17 fine-tune\\\\n    result: success (train_loss=0.105, eval_loss=0.084)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D040\\\\n- id: D046\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: seed456 NER 3-seed 确认：SJ rho=0.384, structural>surface (+0.160)，cross-seed\\\\n    一致性 Δmax=0.044\\\\n  rationale: exp_001_seed456_v2_ner 结果：rho_sj=0.384, structural_beats_surface=true,\\\\n    rho_advantage=0.160, 12.3% F1=0。3-seed 对比：seed42 rho=0.428, seed123 rho=0.424,\\\\n    seed456 rho=0.384。最大 cross-seed Δ=0.044（seed42 vs seed456），比之前报告的 Δ<0.004（seed42\\\\n    vs seed123）大，但三个 seed 全部 structural>surface 且 p<0.001。结论：NER SJ 信号方向稳定，幅度有中等 seed\\\\n    敏感性。论文报告 mean±std：rho=0.412±0.025。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed456_v2_ner\\\\n    role: seed456 NER rerun\\\\n    result: 'MARGINAL: rho=0.384, structural_beats_surface=true, advantage=0.160'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: seed42 reference\\\\n    result: rho=0.428\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed123_v2\\\\n    role: seed123 reference\\\\n    result: rho=0.424\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D047\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: Inverted-U 被否定：RE SJ 按 sent_len 单调递增 (Q1:0.110→Q4:0.473, p=0.004*)，论文 Claim\\\\n    3 禁用 inverted-U 表述\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 对 exp_009_v2_re_rerun（过滤后 397 实例）独立核实：SJ 按 sent_len 分层呈单调递增而非\\\\n    inverted-U。Fisher z p=0.004 显著。同时确认 rel_count 不是独立 proxy（与 ent_count ρ=0.769），论文只应使用\\\\n    sent_len + ent_count 作为独立代理变量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009_v2_re_rerun\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: monotonic increase confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009_capability_stratification\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: original stratification\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n- id: D048\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: FK N-scaling 退化跨设置确认：CoNLL Δ=-0.007, LLaMA SciERC Δ=-0.019，论文需讨论此现象\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 在 N=8→N=16 对比中发现 FK 一致性退化不是随机波动——两个独立设置（Qwen CoNLL + LLaMA SciERC）都显示退化。可能原因：FK\\\\n    对 category-level 频率敏感，N 增大时边缘类别波动增大。SJ 改善 +0.014/+0.016 方向正确。论文应将此作为 SJ 优于 FK\\\\n    的又一论据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_conll_n16\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: FK Δ=-0.007\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_llama_n16\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: FK Δ=-0.019\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D049\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 实验端进入收尾：N=16 跨模型跨数据集确认 SJ N-scaling、FK N-degradation、logprob N-invariant；3-seed\\\\n    鲁棒性全部通过；RE 重跑修复代理独立性。LLaMA CoNLL N=16 为最后一个 GPU 实验\\\\n  rationale: N=16 五信号对比跨 CoNLL 和 SciERC 一致，SJ Δρ 均为正（+0.014/+0.016），FK 均为负（-0.007/-0.019），这提供了\\\\n    Claim 1 (structural > surface) 在 N-scaling 维度的强证据。3-seed SD<0.025 确认结果稳定性。RE rerun\\\\n    修复了 proxy independence 问题（|ρ| 0.512→0.011），Claim 3 数据可靠。剩余只有 LLaMA CoNLL N=16\\\\n    一个 GPU 实验，之后全力转 paper writing。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_conll_n16\\\\n    role: N-scaling cross-dataset\\\\n    result: SJ +0.014, FK -0.007\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_llama_n16\\\\n    role: N-scaling cross-model\\\\n    result: SJ ρ=0.379, voting_conf ρ=0.452\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed456_v2_ner\\\\n    role: 3-seed robustness\\\\n    result: SD<0.025, ranking stable\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009_v2_re_rerun\\\\n    role: RE proxy fix\\\\n    result: SJ 0.063→0.281, ent_count |ρ| 0.512→0.011\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n  - D046\\\\n  - D047\\\\n  - D048\\\\n- id: D050\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: D048 修正：FK N-scaling 非一致退化，而是 setting-dependent（3/4 退化，LLaMA CoNLL 改善 +0.029/+0.032）\\\\n  rationale: 'LLaMA CoNLL N=16 seed42/123 均显示 FK 改善（Δ=+0.029/+0.032