{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012zHMyLnDvzhVQDuiACvRgB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 54\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 方案: ACE05 上验证 structural consistency vs Fleiss'' Kappa 的 correlation\\\\n    差异'\\\\n  rationale: 'PMC12888769 用 surface-level Fleiss'' Kappa 在 zero-shot 模型上得到 ρ=0.20-0.28，我们假设\\\\n    fine-tuned 模型 + structural consistency (soft Jaccard) 能达到 ρ≥0.40。这是整个论文的基础假设——如果\\\\n    structural consistency 不能更好地预测准确率，后续的 adaptive gating 无从谈起。Phase 0 pilot 设计: Qwen3-8B\\\\n    fine-tuned on ACE05, N=8 samples, 200 instances, 对比两种 consistency metric 的 Spearman\\\\n    ρ。Pass ≥0.40, Fail <0.30。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 审查意见，收紧 MVP pass/fail 标准\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 5 个问题，全部合理采纳：(1) PASS 必须要求 EAE (high-headroom subtask) ρ≥0.40，仅\\\\n    NER 通过不够（ceiling effect 可能虚高）；(2) MARGINAL 区间加 time-boxed protocol: N=16 追加 +\\\\n    1天上限；(3) 加 fine-tuning 质量门控 (NER≥73, EAE≥45)，模型不行时先修 fine-tuning；(4) ACE05 今天必须确认；(5)\\\\n    监控 T=1.0 per-sample F1 分布，>30% F1=0 时追加 T=0.7。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: SciERC RE 替代 ACE05 EAE 作为 MVP high-headroom subtask\\\\n  rationale: ACE05 需 LDC 许可，用户未确认。SciERC 公开可得，有 NER+RE 两个 subtask。RE base F1 ~47（与\\\\n    ACE05 EAE ~52 相当），结构复杂度高（entity pair + relation type），headroom 大，是 EAE 的合理替代。PASS\\\\n    标准更新为 RE ρ≥0.40。需要补实现 RE 的 consistency + evaluation + pipeline 支持。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate 0: NER PASS (60.4%), RE FAIL (33.8%). 执行方案 C——当前模型先跑 pilot + 追训改进版，需修复\\\\n    RE evaluation'\\\\n  rationale: RE 33.8% 低于 40% 阈值但不阻塞 pilot：(1) headroom 大，oracle best-of-N 有提升空间；(2)\\\\n    consistency correlation 不要求高绝对 F1，要求 per-instance variance；(3) 弱模型上验证假设结论更强。但\\\\n    Reviewer 发现两个评估缺陷必须先修：(a) 28% test instances 无 gold relations，会在 (consistency=1.0,\\\\n    F1=0) 处制造 artifact，必须排除；(b) 需报告 full ρ 和 conditional ρ（排除 all-samples-F1=0 的 instances），隔离\\\\n    knowledge-gap cluster 的稀释效应。方向反转是系统性错误（consistent wrongness），恰好对应 error taxonomy\\\\n    中的 \\\\\\\"systematic errors\\\\\\\" 类别——本身是有价值的分析数据点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_001\\\\n    role: gate0_eval\\\\n    result: NER 60.4% PASS, RE 33.8% FAIL\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pilot ft_001 结果：FAIL but positive signals. 等 ft_002 结果再做最终判定。\\\\n  rationale: ft_001 pilot 核心数据：RE ρ_sj_full=0.254 (FAIL <0.40), NER ρ_sj=0.362 (接近)。但\\\\n    conditional ρ（排除 knowledge-gap instances 后）显示正面信号：RE conditional ρ_sj=0.352 >\\\\n    ρ_fk=0.311 (Δ=+0.041)，NER conditional ρ_sj=0.369 > ρ_fk=0.357。核心假设\\\\\\\"structural\\\\n    > surface\\\\\\\"在控制 knowledge-gap 后成立。Oracle headroom 极大 (NER +16.9pp, RE +21.7pp)，TTS\\\\n    有巨大潜力。ft_002 (LoRA r=32, 5 epochs) 正在训练，如果 RE F1 提升到 ≥40%，knowledge-gap 减少可能将\\\\n    ρ_sj 推过 0.40。Parse failures 偏高，ft_002 pilot 需增加 max_tokens。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_001\\\\n    role: mvp_pilot\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: RE ρ_sj_full=0.254, NER ρ_sj=0.362. Conditional: RE 0.352, NER\\\\n      0.369. Oracle headroom: RE +21.7pp, NER +16.9pp'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Narrative 选择方案 A (stay-the-course)：等 ft_002_v2 改进 RE 后重跑 pilot，保留强 claim\\\\n  rationale: ft_001 pilot FAIL (RE full ρ_sj=0.254 <0.30)，但诊断结论是模型 RE 质量不足而非假设方向错误。证据：(1)\\\\n    NER 方向全面正确 (SJ>FK, ρ=0.362)；(2) RE conditional ρ=0.352 进入 MARGINAL 且 SJ>FK (+0.041)；(3)\\\\n    58.3% RE samples F1=0 是 knowledge-gap 噪声淹没信号。ft_002_v2 (LoRA r=32, 5 epochs, 降\\\\n    batch + gradient checkpointing 防 OOM) 预期 RE F1 提升到 ≥40%，减少 knowledge-gap instances，将\\\\n    ρ 推向 0.40。成本仅 ~2h (训练 30min + pilot 60min)。如果 ft_002_v2 也不过，conditional ρ 分析作为\\\\n    fallback analytical contribution。不选 B (NER-only 太弱) 或 C (纯 conditional 有 cherry-picking\\\\n    风险)。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_001\\\\n    role: pilot\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: RE full ρ=0.254, cond ρ=0.352; NER ρ=0.362'\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_002\\\\n    role: retrain\\\\n    result: OOM at step 73, restarting as ft_002_v2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate 1 FAIL (RE rho_sj=0.244<0.30), 但 T=1.0 zero rate 44%>30% 触发协议内 T=0.7\\\\n    追加，暂不 pivot\\\\n  rationale: 1) RE full rho_sj=0.244 < 0.30 触发 ROADMAP FAIL 路径；2) 但 44.3% RE F1=0\\\\n    > 30% 阈值，按 Gate 1 设计追加 T=0.7 实验——这是协议预设步骤不是补救；3) RE cond rho_sj=0.316 > 0.30 说明排除\\\\n    all-zero 后进入 MARGINAL 区间，SJ 在\\\\\\\"可做\\\\\\\"实例上仍有信号；4) NER rho_sj=0.383 稳定正面；5) SJ vs FK\\\\n    翻转值得关注但可能与高 zero rate 有关，T=0.7 可能改善。最终 pivot 决策等 T=0.7 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 pilot (ft_002_v2)\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.244 FAIL, NER rho_sj=0.383 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_003\\\\n    role: Gate 1 pilot (ft_001) baseline\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.237, NER rho_sj=0.381\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: E1 否定乘性惩罚假设，Narrative B 排除，确认走 Narrative A (NER-primary + RE diagnostic)\\\\n  rationale: E1 component-wise 分析：head_sj ρ=0.210 远低于 NER ρ=0.383（差 17pp），所有单组件 ρ\\\\n    都低于组合 SJ（0.244），加法/乘法聚合几乎相同（0.243 vs 0.244）。结论：RE consistency 信号本质弱于 NER，是复合错误传播的固有属性，不是\\\\n    metric 设计问题。Narrative B（度量分解修复 RE）不可行。Narrative A（NER 为主 + RE 诊断分析）是唯一可行路径。pilot_005\\\\n    (T=0.7) 作为最后确认仍在运行，设硬截止线：RE rho_sj < 0.30 = 确认 FAIL，不再调参。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: e1_component_wise_re_sj\\\\n    role: RE SJ 分解诊断\\\\n    result: 乘性惩罚假设 REJECTED，head_sj ρ=0.210 << NER 0.383\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 数据源\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.244 FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_005\\\\n    role: T=0.7 最后确认\\\\n    result: 运行中\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: E1 否定乘性惩罚假说，方案 B 排除，确认走方案 A（NER-primary + RE 诊断）\\\\n  rationale: E1 component-wise 分解显示 head_sj ρ=0.210 远低于 NER ρ=0.383，每个 component 单独都比乘性组合差——问题是\\\\n    span-level SJ 对 relation 任务根本缺乏区分力，不是聚合公式问题。additive fix 也无效（ρ差0.001）。方案 B（度量分解\\\\n    pivot）无法修复 RE。方案 A 可行：NER 强正向（ρ=0.383, SJ>FK 12pp, p=7e-20）作为 core claim + RE\\\\n    分解作为诊断贡献。下一步：NER 多数据集验证 + N=16 扩展。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: e1_component_wise_re_sj\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: 乘性惩罚假说 REJECTED, head_sj ρ=0.210 << NER ρ=0.383\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 base\\\\n    result: RE FAIL, NER PASS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: pilot_005 T=0.7 确认 RE full FAIL (rho=0.234<0.30)，但 RE cond rho_sj=0.372\\\\n    全系列最高，SJ>FK 11.8pp。MVP 结论：NER PASS + RE conditional positive + RE full FAIL。进入\\\\n    research 阶段走 Narrative A。\\\\n  rationale: 1) RE full rho_sj=0.234 < 0.30 硬截止线，确认 FAIL，不再调参；2) 但 RE conditional\\\\n    rho_sj=0.372（接近0.40），SJ>FK优势11.8pp——T=0.7自然分离knowledge-gap vs uncertainty两类错误，恰好支撑核心论点；3)\\\\n    T=1.0时FK反超SJ是采样噪声伪像（FK从0.278降到0.184），SJ在conditional set上实际增强；4) NER rho_sj=0.388全系列最高，SJ>FK稳健(p=2e-20)；5)\\\\n    MVP整体：假设部分验证——entity-level有效，relation-level需capability-aware分析。数据足够支撑Narrative\\\\n    A + 丰富的诊断分析。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_005\\\\n    role: T=0.7最后确认\\\\n    result: RE full rho=0.234 FAIL; RE cond rho=0.372 SJ>FK 11.8pp; NER rho=0.388\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: T=1.0 baseline\\\\n    result: RE full rho=0.244; RE cond rho=0.316\\\\n  - exp_id: e1_component_wise_re_sj\\\\n    role: 度量分解诊断\\\\n    result: 乘性假设REJECTED\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream 三档全 3/6 暴露结构性缺陷：缺强 baseline (log-prob/exact-match/entity-voting)\\\\n    是 #1 问题。大幅修订 framing + plan：加 4 个 baseline 实验 (exp-012~015)，扩评估指标，改 framing 为\\\\\\\"系统性比较\\\\n    4 类置信信号\\\\\\\"。需 re-dream 验证。'\\\\n  rationale: Dream dream_20260514T093336 三档（best/median/worst）全部 3/6 Weak Reject。跨档一致的结构性问题：(1)\\\\n    只对比 FK 一个弱 baseline，审稿人必问 log-prob/USC/exact-match；(2) novelty 薄——\\\\\\\"metric substitution\\\\\\\"\\\\n    without theoretical grounding；(3) 公式-实现不一致；(4) 评估指标单一(ρ only)；(5) 引用不足(10 refs)。最关键：如果\\\\n    SJ 不能胜过 log-prob（零额外推理成本），16x 推理成本不合理，论文实际贡献大幅缩水。修订方案：framing 从\\\\\\\"SJ vs FK\\\\\\\"升级为\\\\\\\"4\\\\n    类置信信号系统比较\\\\\\\"，加 exp-012~015 baseline 实验，全部 P0。exp-012 (log-prob) 是 make-or-break。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260514T093336\\\\n    role: Dream simulation\\\\n    result: best 3/6, median 3/6, worst 3/6 — structural issues\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 11:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-012 log-prob baseline: SJ 压倒性胜出 (NER Δρ=+0.217, 2.55x)。Make-or-break\\\\n    通过，论文走\\\\\\\"强贡献\\\\\\\"路线。统一后续数据源为 exp_012 格式（含全指标）。'\\\\n  rationale: 'NER full: SJ ρ=0.357 vs logprob 0.140 (2.55x); NER cond: SJ ρ=0.412\\\\n    vs logprob 0.163; RE cond: SJ 0.368 vs logprob 0.146. Log-prob AUROC=0.591 近乎随机。SJ\\\\n    捕获了模型置信度之外的结构信息，16x 推理成本合理。RE 上所有信号均退化，进一步证实 task-complexity boundary 跨信号家族适用。注意：exp_012\\\\n    重采样导致 SJ ρ=0.357 vs pilot 0.383（Δ=2.6pp），需统一数据源。max_tokens=512 vs pilot 1024 需修正。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_012_logprob_baseline\\\\n    role: make-or-break baseline comparison\\\\n    result: 'SJ >> logprob: NER Δρ=+0.217, AUROC 0.689 vs 0.591'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 11:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-013/014: voting confidence 与 SJ 持平(NER)/更优(RE)。Claim 1 从\\\\\\\"SJ 最优\\\\\\\"修改为\\\\\\\"structural\\\\n    consistency family (SJ+voting) >> log-prob/FK/EM\\\\\\\"。论文贡献从单 metric 升级为 signal family\\\\n    特征描述。'\\\\n  rationale: 'NER: voting_conf ρ=0.392 vs SJ 0.383 (Δ=0.9pp, 噪声级别); RE: voting_conf\\\\n    ρ=0.340 vs SJ 0.244 (Δ=9.6pp, 显著). 两者都远优于 log-prob (0.14) 和 FK (0.26). voting_conf\\\\n    本质是简化版 SJ——都捕获实体跨样本一致性。NER 上无差别说明信息高度重叠; RE 上 voting 更优可能因 relation tuple 稀疏时\\\\n    Jaccard 不稳定。论文 framing 更安全也更有洞察力：发现 structural consistency FAMILY 的优势，而非推销单一 metric。SJ\\\\n    的价值在泛化性（适用于任意结构化输出），voting 在 NER 上更简洁但不泛化。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_013_exact_match\\\\n    role: exact-match baseline\\\\n    result: NER ρ=0.294, RE ρ=0.156 — 偏弱如预期\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_014_entity_voting\\\\n    role: entity voting baseline\\\\n    result: voting_conf NER ρ=0.392 ≈ SJ; RE ρ=0.340 > SJ 0.244\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 11:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Reviewer WARNING: pilot_004 vs exp_012 SJ ρ 不一致 (Δ=0.026-0.033)，根因是 exp_012\\\\n    重新采样而非复用 pilot_004 数据。exp-015 统一计算修复。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 exp_005 温度分析报告混用 pilot_004 的 ρ 和 exp_012 的 τ/AUROC，两者对同一任务的\\\\n    SJ ρ 差 0.026-0.033，与温度效应 Δρ=±0.01 同量级。根因已知：exp_012 生成了新样本而非复用 pilot_004。修复：exp-015\\\\n    从 pilot_004 原始样本统一计算所有指标（ρ/τ/AUROC/bootstrap CI/LOO-SJ），论文所有数字必须来自同一数据源。温度比较（T=1.0\\\\n    vs T=0.7）各自内部一致，核心结论（SJ 温度鲁棒）应该成立但需 bootstrap CI 验证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005\\\\n    role: flagged\\\\n    result: 'WARNING: mixed data sources'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_012_logprob_baseline\\\\n    role: root_cause\\\\n    result: used fresh samples instead of pilot_004\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015_metrics_expansion\\\\n    role: fix\\\\n    result: unified computation from pilot_004\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 2 初步分析 + GPU 全面重新分配：exp_001 补跑全实例集，8 GPU 全排满\\\\n  rationale: Dream 2 best=4/6 (↑1), median=3/6 (持平). Baseline 添加解决了 dream 1 核心问题，但\\\\n    novelty 仍是最大障碍。median 新担忧：SJ vs logprob 可能 dataset-dependent——这是 data-dependent\\\\n    问题，等 exp-002/003 真实数据验证。Reviewer 发现 exp_001 只跑了 200/551 实例（严重），6/8 GPU 空闲。行动：(1)\\\\n    exp_001 在 cuda:0 重跑全实例集 (2) exp_003/007 在 cuda:2/3 启动 (3) gpu-5090-4x-2 分配给 exp_001\\\\n    seeds + exp_008 (4) 新增 exp-016 ensemble 分析 (P0 CPU) 和 exp-017 LLaMA-CoNLL (P1)。Dream\\\\n    2 新增 reviewer concerns R11-R14 已更新到 paper_framing.md。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_ner_n16_scierc\\\\n    role: 需补跑全实例集\\\\n    result: 200/551 实例完成, NER voting_conf ρ=0.401, RE voting_conf ρ=0.448\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_re_diagnostic\\\\n    role: RE diagnostic 完成\\\\n    result: SJ>FK NER 显著, Fisher z NER>RE p=0.021, entity span errors=55.5% FN\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260514T105303\\\\n    role: re-dream 审稿\\\\n    result: best 4/6, median 3/6, worst pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream 2 跨三档分析完成 (best=3/6, median=3/6, worst=3/6): 问题全为结构性，非数据依赖'\\\\n  rationale: '三档评分全部 3/6 (Weak Reject)，说明即使 best-case 数据也无法突破当前 framing/presentation\\\\n    限制。跨档分析提取 19 个 distinct issue，分类如下：\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **确认行动项（三档一致，通用）：**\\\\n\\\\n    1. I1: 相关工作严重不足 [B][M][W] → 35+ refs，补 conformal prediction / token-level NER\\\\n    / ensemble / verifier 文献。Paper Agent P0。\\\\n\\\\n    2. I2: 单 RE 数据集限制 Claim 2 [B][M][W] → 承认 limitation，N-scaling 发现部分缓解。\\\\n\\\\n    3. I3: 缺 SJ+logprob ensemble [B][M][W] → exp-016 已在跑（CPU）。\\\\n\\\\n    4. I4: 新颖性增量 [B][M][W] → 不改架构，通过 ensemble 实验+diagnostic analysis+practical guidelines\\\\n    补强。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **新增 paper_framing.md 条目：** R15 (log-prob 定义歧义), R16 (零图表), R17 (diagnostic framework\\\\n    过度声称→改为 analysis), R18 (何时 consistency 有用), R19 (负面结果可预测性辩护)。R10 更新具体缺失文献清单。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **观察项（两档一致，数据依赖）：**\\\\n\\\\n    - I5: SJ vs logprob dataset-dependent [B][M] → exp-002/003 决定\\\\n\\\\n    - I6: Best-of-N F1 差异不显著 [B][M] → exp-016 bootstrap CI 验证\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **忽略项：** best tier 的 data integrity concern（dream artifact），narrative repositioning\\\\n    concern（dream 对内部决策日志的过度解读）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **Claim 2 决策：** 批准从\\\\\\\"task-complexity boundary\\\\\\\"升级为\\\\\\\"sample-complexity gradient\\\\\\\"，但需全实例集\\\\n    T=1.0 确认后才正式写入。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **不 re-dream：** 所有确认行动项均为 paper writing 级别（Paper Agent 处理），非 framing 结构性改变。P0\\\\n    实验已全部审批并运行，等真实数据后再评估是否 re-dream。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260514T105303\\\\n    role: dream\\\\n    result: best=3/6, median=3/6, worst=3/6 — 全结构性问题\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016\\\\n    role: addresses I3 (ensemble)\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002\\\\n    role: validates I5 (dataset dependency)\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003\\\\n    role: validates I5 (dataset dependency)\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 2 全三档 3/6 (Weak Reject) — 问题是结构性的(presentation/positioning)，非数据问题。确认行动项：reframe\\\\n    novelty + 扩展 related work 35+ refs + 添加 3+ figures + soften diagnostic framework\\\\n    claim。观察项：SJ vs LOGPROB dataset-dependency (等 exp-002/003)、Best-of-N significance\\\\n    (等 exp-006/015)、cross-model stability (等 exp-007)。已运行 GPU 实验继续（数据收集独立于 framing）。framing\\\\n    修改完成后 re-dream 验证。\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream 2 三档一致问题: (D01) novelty = metric substitution, (D02) related work\\\\n    thin, (D03) single RE dataset。两档一致: ensemble missing (exp-016 已规划), diagnostic\\\\n    framework overclaimed, negative result predictability。Best case 都无法达到 4/6 说明 framing\\\\n    + positioning 是 bottleneck, 不是 experimental evidence。Paper Agent 是 critical path\\\\n    — related work 扩展、figures 添加、contribution reframe 比新 GPU 实验更紧急。但 GPU 实验(esp exp-002/003\\\\n    cross-dataset validation)的结果将决定 Claim 1 的最终强度。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-016\\\\n    role: planned_mitigation\\\\n    result: addresses D04 (ensemble missing) — P0, CPU-only\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: observation_target\\\\n    result: will determine if SJ vs LOGPROB is dataset-dependent (D05)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: observation_target\\\\n    result: will determine if SJ vs LOGPROB is dataset-dependent (D05)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-007\\\\n    role: observation_target\\\\n    result: will determine cross-model stability (D20)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-015\\\\n    role: planned_mitigation\\\\n    result: addresses D12 (bootstrap CIs) — already planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-016 揭示 correlation-selection gap: 结构一致性信号 instance-level ρ~0.43 但\\\\n    best-of-N 选择全部不如 greedy (NER)。Paper framing 必须从 \\\\\\\"TTS improvement\\\\\\\" 转向 \\\\\\\"confidence\\\\n    signal analysis\\\\\\\"，核心贡献升级为发现 quality estimation ≠ sample selection。'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-016 best-of-N 选择结果：NER 所有信号均不如 greedy (best: logprob 0.6087 vs greedy\\\\n    0.6094)；RE 仅 logprob (+2.4pp) 超过 greedy，结构信号均失败。Oracle headroom 巨大 (NER +16pp)\\\\n    但不可达。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    根因分析：SJ/voting_conf 是 instance-level aggregate (一个 instance 一个分数)，无法对 instance\\\\n    内的 N 个 sample 排序；logprob 是天然 per-sample 信号但 NER 上 greedy 已接近最优，采样只增加噪声。RE 上模型不确定性更大，部分\\\\n    sample 优于 greedy，logprob 可以发现它们。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    这改变了论文的核心叙事：\\\\n\\\\n    - 旧 framing: \\\\\\\"SJ 是 TTS 最佳信号 → 用更多 compute 换更高质量\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - 新 framing: \\\\\\\"结构一致性是最强的质量估计信号 (instance-level)，但 quality estimation ≠ sample selection\\\\n    → correlation-selection gap 是 structured IE TTS 的根本挑战\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    correlation-selection gap 是 genuinely novel finding，比原来的 \\\\\\\"SJ vs logprob ranking\\\\\\\"\\\\n    更有概念贡献，可能正好解决 Dream 审稿反复提的 novelty 不足问题。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016_signal_ensemble\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: 'NER best-of-N: all signals < greedy; RE: only logprob +2.4pp > greedy;\\\\n      ensemble AUROC +3.5pp NER, -0.2pp RE; data leakage in Part 4'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_012_logprob_baseline\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: instance-level SJ >> logprob (ρ 0.383 vs 0.140)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_014_entity_voting\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: voting_conf instance-level ρ=0.392, AUROC=0.704 — strong estimation but\\\\n      cannot select\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: '论文叙事关键转向: 从 \\\\\\\"TTS improvement via structural consistency\\\\\\\" 转向 \\\\\\\"confidence\\\\n    estimation for structured IE + correlation-selection gap analysis\\\\\\\"。exp-016 证明\\\\n    best-of-N selection 在 NER 上全部不如 greedy，RE 仅 logprob 胜出。instance-level correlation\\\\n    ≠ per-sample selection 是核心新发现。'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-016 数据不可回避:\\\\n\\\\n    1. NER best-of-N: greedy 0.6094 > 所有信号（logprob 0.6087, sj 0.6042, voting 0.5959）。Oracle\\\\n    headroom +16pp 但无信号可利用。\\\\n\\\\n    2. RE best-of-N: 仅 logprob 0.3971 > greedy 0.3735，结构信号全部不如 greedy。\\\\n\\\\n    3. Instance-level AUROC: voting_conf 0.700, SJ 0.689 >> logprob 0.591 → quality\\\\n    estimation 仍然有效。\\\\n\\\\n    4. Ensemble: NER AUROC +3.5pp（微弱），RE -0.2pp（无提升）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    结论: 结构一致性信号擅长\\\\\\\"预测哪些实例做得好\\\\\\\"(quality estimation)，但不能\\\\\\\"从 N 个 sample 中选出最好的\\\\\\\"(selection)。paper_framing.md\\\\n    的 Story Spine 预设 best-of-N 正面结果，现在不成立。必须 pivot。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    Reviewer 独立审查确认: (1) C1-B 降 P2 (2) C3-B TACRED 不可行降 P3 (3) R4 mitigation 失效 (4)\\\\n    叙事一致性是最大风险。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    新叙事方向: confidence estimation + correlation-selection gap as novel finding + task-complexity\\\\n    boundary。所有现有实验数据仍有效，pivot 不需要重新跑实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-016\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: best-of-N selection 全部不如 greedy (NER); RE 仅 logprob 胜出; instance-level\\\\n      AUROC 仍有效\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: adaptive compute demo 的 best-of-N framing 需要重新设计\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: logprob ρ=0.140 vs SJ 0.383 — instance-level 差距大但 selection 差距小/反转\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-014\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: voting_conf AUROC 0.704 — quality estimation 仍是最强信号\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-002 CoNLL: EM > SJ (Δρ=-0.015, significant) — signal ranking is task-difficulty-dependent.\\\\n    SJ >> logprob confirmed cross-dataset (Δρ=+0.120). Voting first to beat greedy\\\\n    (+0.18pp). Framing: optimal signal depends on task difficulty, not universal winner.'\\\\n  rationale: 'CoNLL (easy task, greedy F1=91.2%): EM ρ=0.451 (#1) > SJ 0.436 (#2)\\\\n    > voting 0.424 (#3). SciERC (hard task, F1=67%): voting 0.392 (#1) > SJ 0.383\\\\n    (#2) > EM 0.294 (#4). EM jumps from #4 to #1 across difficulty levels.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    根因: 简单任务上 sample 输出高度一致, exact match 足以捕获一致性, SJ 的 soft matching 无额外价值。困难任务上 sample\\\\n    间差异大, 需要结构化匹配 (SJ) 来识别有意义的一致性。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    对叙事的影响:\\\\n\\\\n    - Claim 1 从 \\\\\\\"SJ universally best\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"optimal signal is task-difficulty-dependent:\\\\n    SJ for hard tasks, EM for easy tasks\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - 这实际上 EXTENDS Claim 3 (task-complexity boundary): 不仅 NER↔RE 有 boundary, NER 内部不同难度也有\\\\n    boundary\\\\n\\\\n    - 增加了论文概念深度: signal utility = f(task difficulty)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    关键确认:\\\\n\\\\n    - SJ >> logprob 跨数据集稳健 (SciERC Δρ=+0.217, CoNLL Δρ=+0.120, both significant)\\\\n\\\\n    - Voting 首次 beat greedy (CoNLL +0.18pp) → correlation-selection gap 也是 task-difficulty-dependent\\\\n\\\\n    - All signals AUROC > 0.75 on CoNLL → easy tasks 上信号选择 ROI 低\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    ⚠️ AUROC bug: pilot script logprob AUROC=0.5000 (F1=1.0 二值化问题), 需修复以免 WNUT 复现。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_ner_conll2003\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: EM ρ=0.451 > SJ 0.436 > voting 0.424 > FK 0.400 > logprob 0.316. SJ vs\\\\n      logprob Δρ=+0.120 significant. Voting beats greedy +0.18pp.\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016_signal_ensemble\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 'SciERC: no signal beats greedy. CoNLL: voting beats greedy → correlation-selection\\\\n      gap is task-difficulty-dependent.'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_012_logprob_baseline\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: SciERC SJ >> logprob confirmed. CoNLL adds cross-dataset validation.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-002 CoNLL SUCCESS: Claim 1 跨数据集验证通过，SJ vs logprob Δρ=+0.12 bootstrap显著，信号排序与SciERC一致'\\\\n  rationale: 'CoNLL-2003 NER (N=8, T=1.0): SJ ρ=0.436 vs logprob ρ=0.316, Δρ=+0.12,\\\\n    95% CI [+0.088, +0.154]。所有结构信号 > logprob，排序与 SciERC 一致。EM 在 CoNLL 略胜 SJ (+0.015)，表明高准确率场景下\\\\n    EM 更有效，但 SJ 泛化性更强——论文应讨论此 tradeoff。CoNLL 整体 ρ 值更高（SJ 0.436 vs SciERC 0.398），支持\\\\n    Claim 2 的 task-complexity 叙事：简单任务信号更强。FK 涨幅最大 (+0.112)，表面匹配在高 F1 regime 更有效。Claim\\\\n    1 现在有 2/3 数据集验证，等 exp-003 WNUT 完成后达到 3 个。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_ner_conll2003\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_ner_wnut17\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: 激活 Paper Agent Full Draft + GPU 全面恢复指令。Paper Agent 启动条件满足（P0 完成度\\\\n    75%, 3 claims 各 ≥2 settings 支撑）。GPU 空闲 28 分钟不可接受，发综合指令要求立即排满 8 卡。'\\\\n  rationale: Dream 2 全三档 3/6 瓶颈是 presentation 不是实验数据。11 天 DDL，Paper Agent 是关键路径——越早启动越好。GPU\\\\n    利用率 0/8 是硬伤，必须立即修复。exp-001 seed123 和 exp-007 LLaMA 两个失败需要诊断修复。Conditional filtering\\\\n    修复完成可以 unblock T=1.0 全集重跑。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: CoNLL 成功，Paper Agent 激活条件满足\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-016\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: ensemble 分析完成，correlation-selection gap 确认\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: blocked\\\\n    result: seed123 失败待诊断\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-007\\\\n    role: blocked\\\\n    result: LLaMA NER 失败待诊断\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: RE task SJ vs FK 排序在 joint 模式和 RE-only 模式之间反转，论文必须明确标注 evaluation protocol\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现：Joint 模式 seed123 RE SJ ρ=0.267 < FK ρ=0.315（FK wins），RE-only\\\\n    模式 seed42 RE SJ ρ=0.304 > FK ρ=0.269（SJ wins）。可能原因：(1) joint 模式下 NER 错误传播到 RE，(2)\\\\n    seed 效应。论文若 claim SJ 在 RE 上优于 FK，必须区分 joint vs RE-only protocol，否则审稿人可攻击。后续需要：同\\\\n    seed 下对比 joint vs RE-only 以隔离变量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_ner_n16_seed123\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'joint模式 RE: SJ ρ=0.267 < FK ρ=0.315'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008_re_n16_full\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'RE-only模式: SJ ρ=0.304 > FK ρ=0.269'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: RE full set 上 SJ 不优于 FK（2/3 seeds FK > SJ），论文 claim 必须按评估 regime 分层\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立核实 3 seeds N=16 T=1.0 全集结果：RE full set SJ rho 均值 ~0.26 vs\\\\n    FK ~0.29（FK 在 seed123/42 上反超）。但 conditional set（排除 F1=0 ~44% 样本后）SJ 恢复优势（mean\\\\n    rho_sj ~0.32 vs rho_fk ~0.14）。logprob 在 conditional set 近乎零（-0.03~0.02）。论文叙事调整为：(1)\\\\n    NER：SJ 稳健优于 FK/logprob；(2) RE full set：所有信号弱且差异不显著，根因是 ~44% zero-F1 实例；(3) RE\\\\n    conditional：SJ 恢复优势且 logprob 失效 → structural signals 在排除 knowledge-gap 后仍有价值。这比\\\\n    \\\\\\\"SJ always wins\\\\\\\" 更诚实，且 conditional 分析是独特贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed456_t10_full\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'RE full: SJ 0.268 vs FK 0.260 (marginal)'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed123_t10_full\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'RE full: SJ 0.265 vs FK 0.315 (FK wins)'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008_re_n16_t10_full\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'RE-only: SJ 0.304 > FK 0.269'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: WNUT17 SJ rho=0.082 近乎失效，暂停纳入 Claim 1 泛化证据，待诊断数据质量后决定论文定位\\\\n  rationale: 'WNUT17 pilot: rho_sj=0.082, logprob=-0.414, greedy_f1=0.525, 53.7% zero-rate。三种可能：(1)\\\\n    数据格式 bug（gold_empty 46.5% 异常高需验证）；(2) 模型能力不足导致 SJ 无信号（高一致性+低准确 = 一致地错）；(3) SJ\\\\n    方法在社交媒体噪声文本上的真实边界。诊断前不做 framing 决定。如果是 (2)/(3)，WNUT17 可正面利用为 Claim 3 补充——一致性 ≠\\\\n    正确性是方法的重要边界条件。如果是 (1)，修复后重跑。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_ner_wnut17\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: rho_sj=0.082, logprob=-0.414, greedy_f1=0.525\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: WNUT-17 SJ 近乎失效(ρ=0.082)，需先诊断数据质量再决定论文定位\\\\n  rationale: WNUT17 greedy_f1=0.525, 53.7% zero-F1, SJ rho=0.082, logprob rho=-0.414。两种可能：(1)\\\\n    数据格式/评估 bug → 修复后重跑；(2) 模型能力不足的真实边界条件（SJ_mean=0.882 说明一致但错误）。如果是 (2)，可作为 Claim\\\\n    3 (task-complexity boundary) 的延伸——不仅任务难度，模型能力不足也会使信号退化。conditional set SJ 恢复到\\\\n    0.275 > FK 0.164 支持此叙事。已派 Agent 诊断，结果决定最终 framing。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_ner_wnut17\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: SJ rho=0.082, logprob rho=-0.414, greedy_f1=0.525, 53.7% zero-F1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-007 LLaMA cross-model PASS: SJ model-agnostic claim 成立。RE cond SJ=0.405\\\\n    首破 0.40。补算 voting_conf/EM (CPU)，N=16 重跑列为 P1'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer PASS。LLaMA NER rho_sj=0.363 vs Qwen 0.383，信号排序完全一致 (SJ>FK>logprob)。RE\\\\n    conditional SJ=0.405 是全项目首次破 0.40，且 logprob RE_cond 在 LLaMA 上不显著(p=0.143)，强化 SJ>>logprob\\\\n    on RE 的 claim。两个 warning 处理：(1) voting_conf/EM 从 samples.jsonl 补算，零 GPU 成本，必做；(2)\\\\n    N=16 重跑列为 P1——当前 N=8 足够支撑定性 cross-model claim，论文表格注明 N 差异即可，有 GPU 余量再补 N=16。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_llama_inference\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: LLaMA NER rho_sj=0.363, RE rho_sj=0.299, RE_cond_sj=0.405\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: WNUT-17 P0 修复批准：下采样空实例 ≤25% 重训+重推理。无论结果如何都对论文 story 有利（task-difficulty-dependent\\\\n    证据或跨域泛化证据）\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 确认根因：训练集 63.8% 空实例 vs SciERC 0%，导致模型过强空输出先验，SJ/logprob 信号失效。修复成本仅\\\\n    ~3h GPU，当前 7/8 GPU 空闲，成本微不足道。修复后两种结果均有价值：(1) SJ 恢复 > logprob → 跨域泛化证据；(2) SJ 仍\\\\n    < logprob → task-difficulty-dependent signal ranking 的第三个数据点（CoNLL: EM>SJ, SciERC:\\\\n    SJ>>logprob, WNUT: logprob≥SJ），与 D020 narrative 完美互补。空实例率对 consistency 信号的影响机制本身也是论文值得讨论的分析洞察。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_ner_wnut17\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'SJ rho=0.082 (full), 0.275-0.288 (conditional); root cause: 63.8% empty\\\\n      training instances'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: WNUT-17 降级 P2，转为 negative case study（方法边界分析）。D028 重训仍保留但仅在 P0 实验全部排满后有余力时执行\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立验证确认：WNUT-17 训练数据 63.8% 空实例是 SJ 失效根因（vs SciERC 0%）。CoNLL-2003\\\\n    已提供跨数据集验证（exp-002 success），LLaMA 提供跨模型验证（exp-007 pass）。DDL 11 天，WNUT-17 重训 ROI\\\\n    不确定——即使重训后 SJ 可能仍弱（社交媒体实体歧义大）。更好的论文定位：WNUT-17 作为 method boundary analysis——\\\\\\\"当训练数据空实例比例过高时，模型习得过强空输出先验，所有置信信号均退化\\\\\\\"。这比忽略结果更诚实，也是\\\\n    framing 升级（展示方法适用边界 = 学术严谨性）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_ner_wnut17\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: SJ rho=0.082 near failure\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_ner_conll2003\\\\n    role: alternative evidence\\\\n    result: success, cross-dataset validated\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: LLaMA cross-model SJ 确认完成。NER SJ>logprob 跨模型成立。LLaMA N=16 不补跑（N=8 足够支撑\\\\n    model-agnostic claim）\\\\n  rationale: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B N=8: NER ρ_sj=0.363 vs ρ_logprob=0.183，SJ>logprob 优势比 Qwen\\\\n    上更大。两个模型架构 SJ ranking 一致，足够支撑 model-agnostic claim。N=8 vs N=16 不影响 signal ranking\\\\n    结论（cross-model 验证的目标是 ranking 一致性不是绝对值）。DDL 11 天，GPU 时间优先给 exp-001 seed robustness\\\\n    和 exp-008 RE N=16。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_llama_inference\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: NER ρ_sj=0.363(LLaMA) vs 0.398(Qwen), ρ_logprob=0.183 vs 0.237. Cross-model\\\\n      SJ>logprob confirmed.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准 WNUT-17 P0 修复：下采样空实例到≤25%重训，8 GPU 全分配铺开 P0 实验\\\\n  rationale: WNUT-17 训练数据 63.8% 空实例导致模型对空输出过度自信（logprob≈-0.007），full 集 SJ ρ=0.082。方法在非空预测上有效（conditional\\\\n    ρ=0.288）。P0 修复成本低（~3h），预期显著提升 full 集指标。同时 8 GPU 全部分配：WNUT 重训(1)+NER N=16 三种子(3)+LLaMA\\\\n    fine-tune(2)+logprob baseline(1)+RE N=16(1)，CPU 并行跑 exact-match 和 entity voting\\\\n    baseline。DDL 11 天，不允许空卡。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: P0 retrain approved\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: parallel\\\\n    result: 3 seeds queued\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-007\\\\n    role: parallel\\\\n    result: pending status confirmation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: parallel\\\\n    result: logprob baseline queued\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: parallel\\\\n    result: RE N=16 queued\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 收尾阶段：批准 exp-017 LLaMA CoNLL (2 GPU)，WNUT-17 重训跳过（D029 boundary framing\\\\n    成立）\\\\n  rationale: P0 实验全部完成。exp-017 补上 cross-model×cross-dataset 2×2 矩阵最后一格（LLaMA 目前只在\\\\n    SciERC 验证），10 GPU-hours 成本低、对 model-agnostic claim 收益高。WNUT-17 重训跳过：D029 已将其定位为\\\\n    method boundary analysis，Paper Agent 已纳入论文 framing（空实例占比过高时所有信号退化），重训边际收益低于论文写作聚焦。剩余\\\\n    2 GPU 保留给 AUROC bugfix rerun 和 Paper Agent 数据需求。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-017\\\\n    role: approved\\\\n    result: LLaMA CoNLL fine-tune + inference\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: skipped\\\\n    result: D029 boundary case study framing stands\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新颖性自查通过：核心 idea 在 2024-2026 文献中无直接竞争者，需补引 4 篇 2025-2026 必引文献\\\\n  rationale: Manager 要求做新颖性自查。搜索 Semantic Scholar/arXiv/ACL Anthology 8 个维度，确认：(1)\\\\n    无论文同时做 structured IE 多信号对比 + set-aware consistency + correlation-selection gap；(2)\\\\n    最接近的 CISC(ACL'25)、Self-Certainty(ICLR'26)、ReASC(2026) 均限于 reasoning 离散答案，不处理 set-structured\\\\n    IE；(3) related work 需补 CISC、Self-Certainty、ReASC、Atomic SC 等 2025-2026 文献，并新增\\\\n    TTS & Sample Selection 小节。已更新 paper_framing.md R10。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新颖性自查（第二轮）：发现直接竞争者 Nédellec 2026，核心新颖性仍成立，需补引 3 篇\\\\n  rationale: 'Manager 要求深度新颖性自查。搜索 Semantic Scholar + Web 发现最直接竞争者 Nédellec & Xia\\\\n    (Genomics Informatics, 2026-02): consistency-accuracy correlation for NER/RE with\\\\n    4 LLMs。但他们只用 surface-level string matching、不研究 best-of-N selection、单领域 hard-prompted。我们的\\\\n    SJ structural metrics + 5 信号家族系统比较 + correlation-selection gap 均为差异化贡献。同时发现 CoCoA\\\\n    (NeurIPS 2025) 和 Vashurin 2025 系统评估需补引。已更新 paper_framing.md R10 新增 3 篇文献 + 新增\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Consistency for Structured IE\\\\\\\" related work 小节要求。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Heatmap数据源统一：采用方案A，全部用exp_015统一评估数据。Voting显著领先SJ（NER ρ 0.502 vs 0.357），调整叙事为\\\\\\\"structural\\\\n    consistency family\\\\\\\"内互补定位\\\\n  rationale: 审计发现heatmap混用3个独立推理run（pilot_004 SJ/FK/voting/EM + exp_012 logprob +\\\\n    可能pilot_005 RE cond），同instance entity集合不同。方案A用exp_015统一5信号在同一推理run上的评估，数据诚信度最高。叙事调整：voting是NER最强单信号（ρ=0.502），SJ的独特价值重新定位为(a)温度鲁棒Δρ≤0.01\\\\n    (b)泛化到任意structured output (c)conditional filtering下ρ=0.412仍强 (d)与voting ensemble互补（exp-016\\\\n    AUROC 0.735）。\\\\\\\"Structural consistency family\\\\\\\"（SJ+voting）仍为最强家族，内部分工更清晰。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015\\\\n    role: 统一评估数据源\\\\n    result: voting ρ=0.502 >> SJ 0.357 NER full\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016\\\\n    role: ensemble验证\\\\n    result: SJ+voting ensemble AUROC 0.735\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Heatmap 数据源：采用方案 D（v2 统一推理数据替换），exp_015 数据源不可信\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 发现 exp_015 数据源三重不一致（registry 说 pilot_004、代码注释说 pilot_005\\\\n    T=0.7、实际指向 exp_012）。exp_015 不能作为 ground truth。方案 A 排除。方案 D：用正在运行的 v2 实验（exp-001v2\\\\n    seed42 N=16，含全部 5 信号同源推理）替换 SciERC heatmap 数据。优势：(1) 同一 inference run 天然无混源; (2)\\\\n    N=16 统计功效更高; (3) 不额外占 GPU。N=16 vs CoNLL N=8 在图中注明即可。若 v2 失败则 fallback 到方案 C（1\\\\n    GPU-hour 统一 N=8 重新推理）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015\\\\n    role: 问题源\\\\n    result: 数据源三重不一致，不可信\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: 替代数据源\\\\n    result: RUNNING, N=16 全信号同源\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: N=16 结果确认：NER SJ scaling 成立(+0.071)，RE full SJ≈logprob(0.281 vs 0.287)但RE\\\\n    cond logprob 崩溃(-0.026)。叙事需任务分化\\\\n  rationale: exp-001v2 (seed42/123) + exp-008v2 (RE N=16) 三实验完成。NER seed鲁棒性极佳(SJ Δ<0.01)。N=16\\\\n    NER SJ从0.357→0.428(+0.071)，支持scaling叙事。但RE full上logprob 0.287反超SJ 0.281，不能笼统声称\\\\\\\"结构信号全面领先\\\\\\\"。RE\\\\n    cond上logprob完全失效(ρ=-0.026, p=0.685)而SJ仍有0.308——支持Claim 3的conditional filtering价值。叙事调整：NER全面领先\\\\n    + RE full持平 + RE cond结构信号独特价值。v2缺voting_conf和EM，需零GPU后处理补全。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: NER N=16 seed robustness\\\\n    result: SJ full ρ=0.428, cross-seed Δ<0.01\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_seed123_v2\\\\n    role: NER N=16 seed robustness\\\\n    result: SJ full ρ=0.424\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008_re_n16_v2\\\\n    role: RE N=16 validation\\\\n    result: SJ full ρ=0.281 ≈ logprob 0.287, SJ cond 0.308 vs logprob -0.026\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: NER seed 鲁棒性确认；RE subtask 结构一致性信号系统性偏弱\\\\n  rationale: exp_001 三个 seed (42/123/456 v2) NER SJ ρ 高度一致 (0.428/0.424)，结构信号稳定优于表面信号\\\\n    (+0.147/0.149)，cross-seed robustness 确认。RE 方面，exp_008 所有变体 (v2/seed123) + exp_007\\\\n    LLaMA (seed123/456) 全部 FAIL：full set SJ ρ 均 <0.30，F1=0 比例 >40%。RE 的 conditional\\\\n    set 有信号 (SJ ρ 0.29-0.40)，但 full set 一致性信号弱是系统性问题，非随机波动。论文 framing 应将 RE 定位为 honest\\\\n    negative finding + conditional analysis 的 nuanced story。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  -