 Superficial ensemble analysis.** No hybrid strategy tested (structural filtering + logprob ranking).\n\n**Key questions:**\n- Per-sample variants of structural signals for selection?\n- How would practitioners do conditional filtering without gold labels?\n- How exactly is voting used for selection?\n- Sensitivity to fine-tuning quality?\n\n---\n\nYour previous key weaknesses were:\n- W1: Tautological correlation-selection gap\n- W2: Insufficient differentiation from Nédellec & Xia 2026\n- W3: No proposed solution\n- W4: Ambiguous positioning\n- W5: Missing MBR decoding connection\n- W6: \"Logprob paradox\" is well-known"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10779,"cache_read_input_tokens":73689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10779},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a188aefa-23b6-4688-b448-164a4ee4e586","uuid":"e35735b7-afbc-470c-9bb2-e18f52ceb3ec"}
